#! ia 1.0

@schema contract
  lowers to contract
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have relationships
    may have inputs
    may have outputs
    may have preconditions
    may have invariants
    may have failures
    may have authority
    may have context
    may have evolution
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    must have meaning.answers as text
    must have head.version as text
